# =============================================================================
#  NEON-Ground-Beetle-Tracker environment manifest
#
#  Every setting this project reads. Committed. No real values, ever. Copy to
#  .Renviron (R reads it at startup) or export in your shell; never commit the
#  filled-in copy. An empty value counts as unset everywhere in this repo.
#
#: manifest-version 1
# =============================================================================

## Group: NEON data access

#: purpose  NEON API token for the release-pinned data refresh (data endpoints refuse anonymous requests).
#: source   data.neonscience.org account page; in GitHub Actions the NEON_TOKEN repository secret.
#: required no
#: secret   yes
#: class    credential
#: targets  local, actions
NEON_TOKEN=''

#: purpose  Pinned NEON release for the refresh and data/release.rds; unset or empty means RELEASE-2026.
#: source   Set at workflow level in .github/workflows/refresh-data.yml; bump only in a reviewed PR.
#: required no
#: secret   no
#: default  RELEASE-2026
#: targets  local, actions
GBT_RELEASE=''

## Group: App runtime

#: purpose  CARTO basemap key; public by design (it travels in tile URLs), so restrict it by referrer.
#: source   CARTO dashboard; on Posit Connect Cloud a content variable, not a repo secret.
#: required no
#: secret   no
#: targets  local, posit-connect
CARTO_BASEMAP_KEY=''

#: purpose  0 turns off live NEON fetches in the app; unset or empty allows them only when neonUtilities is installed.
#: source   Local choice. The deployed app has no neonUtilities and serves the committed bundle.
#: required no
#: secret   no
#: default  (unset)
#: targets  local, actions
GBT_LIVE=''

## Group: Refresh producer

#: purpose  1 stops the refresh after the staged site roster is validated (the workflow promotes it).
#: source   Set by the refresh workflow's build step.
#: required no
#: secret   no
#: default  0
#: targets  actions
GBT_REFRESH_BUILD_ONLY=''

#: purpose  Staging directory for downloaded site bundles; unset or empty means data/sites.
#: source   Set by the refresh workflow's build step.
#: required no
#: secret   no
#: default  data/sites
#: targets  actions
GBT_SITE_OUT_DIR=''

## Group: Post-deploy smoke check (scripts/post_deploy_smoke.sh)

#: purpose  Exact ddl-app-ready meta content to expect; the workflow passes "ground-beetle-tracker-v1 build=<digest>".
#: source   Computed by .github/workflows/post-deploy.yml from scripts/build_digest.sh.
#: required no
#: secret   no
#: default  ground-beetle-tracker-v1
#: targets  actions
SMOKE_APP_MARKER=''

#: purpose  Number of polling attempts before the smoke check gives up.
#: source   Optional override; the script has a default.
#: required no
#: secret   no
#: default  10
#: targets  actions
SMOKE_MAX_ATTEMPTS=''

#: purpose  First back-off delay in seconds between attempts.
#: source   Optional override; the script has a default.
#: required no
#: secret   no
#: default  5
#: targets  actions
SMOKE_SLEEP_BASE=''

#: purpose  Longest back-off delay in seconds between attempts.
#: source   Optional override; the script has a default.
#: required no
#: secret   no
#: default  40
#: targets  actions
SMOKE_SLEEP_CAP=''

#: purpose  curl connect timeout in seconds per request.
#: source   Optional override; the script has a default.
#: required no
#: secret   no
#: default  15
#: targets  actions
SMOKE_CONNECT_TIMEOUT=''

#: purpose  curl total time limit in seconds per request.
#: source   Optional override; the script has a default.
#: required no
#: secret   no
#: default  45
#: targets  actions
SMOKE_MAX_TIME=''
